<title>ITALY: Italy plans to issue long-term bond in guilders.</title>
<headline>Italy plans to issue long-term bond in guilders.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy said on Wednesday it intended to issue a long-term bond denominated in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>A Treasury statement said that ABN AMRO Hoare Govett will act as bookrunner for the issue.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom 39 6 678 2501</p>
</text>
